cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "This metadata describes the repository before its first archived release. No version, release date, or DOI is asserted. Cite the exact commit used until a versioned release exists."
title: "Traffic-Signal Evidence Audit: Code and Derived Artifacts"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A curated, partial inspection and reproduction package containing corrected
  evidence tools, tests, protocol records, selected derived research records,
  and retained supplementary analyses for an audit of guarded traffic-signal
  control experiments. The package is not a complete execution ledger and does
  not include the manuscript, road networks, route files, raw traces, or model
  weights.
